 superset; cached optional credentials do not select another service.","+- **A credential's availability never chooses the service.** Passive forwarding sends an optional resource only when the primary default sign-in already grants its scopes, including as a broader superset. When the host offers several Copilot services, it sends only the one the user picked at setup, and none without a recorded pick; the host takes it as the choice."," "," The SDK binds Microsoft authentication to a session, so the catalog comes from the setup session's `rpc.model.list()`, not the global token-based API. The runtime cannot resolve managed settings for a Microsoft account yet, so the host applies none to that account's catalog; do not read policy from the setup session to compensate."," "],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/common/copilotAccountContext.ts","lines":["@@ -3,8 +3,10 @@","  *  Licensed under the MIT License. See License.txt in the project root for license information.","  *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/"," ","+import type { CopilotServiceKind } from '../../../base/common/defaultAccount.js';","+"," export interface ICopilotServiceChoice {","-\treadonly service: 'github' | 'm365';","+\treadonly service: CopilotServiceKind;"," \treadonly resource: string;"," \treadonly selectionId: string;"," \treadonly host: string;"],"additions":3,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/common/copilotEntraAuthentication.ts","lines":["@@ -3,6 +3,8 @@","  *  Licensed under the MIT License. See License.txt in the project root for license information.","  *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/"," ","+import type { CopilotServiceKind } from '../../../base/common/defaultAccount.js';","+"," export const copilotEntraClientId = 'aebc6443-996d-45c2-90f0-388ff96faa56';"," export const copilotEntraAuthori